Michelin stars over the Douro","si_tag":"culinary","status":"future","tier":"premier","price_band":"~€150-250/pp","timing":"Sep-Oct harvest  + Jun-Aug summer","draw_rank":1,"when_source":"derived from destination timing","timing_type":"SEASONAL-WINDOW","hook":"Chef Ricardo Costa''s tasting menu and a 25,000-bottle all-Portuguese cellar, on the hill above the Gaia Port lodges","si":"culinary","blurb":"Chef Ricardo Costa''s tasting menu and a 25,000-bottle all-Portuguese cellar, on the hill above the Gaia Port lodges","when":"Sep-Oct harvest  + Jun-Aug summer","commission":"venue/host","source":"https://www.the-yeatman-hotel.com/en/food/restaurant/","accessed":"2026-07-27"},{"name":"Port at the Vila Nova de Gaia lodges","si_tag":"culinary","status":"future","tier":"essential","price_band":"~€15-75/pp","timing":"Sep-Oct harvest  + Jun-Aug summer","draw_rank":2,"when_source":"derived from destination timing","timing_type":"SEASONAL-WINDOW","hook":"taste Port where it is aged — the great Gaia lodges across the river from Porto''s Ribeira, an 18th-century tradition","si":"culinary","blurb":"taste Port where it is aged — the great Gaia lodges across the river from Porto''s Ribeira, an 18th-century tradition","when":"Sep-Oct harvest  + Jun-Aug summer","commission":"venue/DMC 10-15%","source":"https://whc.unesco.org/en/list/1046/","accessed":"2026-07-27"},{"name":"Douro DOC table wine at a valley quinta","si_tag":"culinary","status":"future","tier":"essential","price_band":"~€15-90/pp","timing":"year-round; harvest Sep-Oct","draw_rank":3,"hook":"the unfortified side of the same terroir — a quinta tasting in the Régua–Pinhão heart","si":"culinary","blurb":"the unfortified side of the same terroir — a quinta tasting in the Régua–Pinhão heart","when":"year-round; harvest Sep-Oct","commission":"venue/DMC","source":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Douro_DOC","accessed":"2026-07-27"},{"name":"Porto''s table — francesinha to the Bolhao","si_tag":"culinary","status":"future","tier":"essential","price_band":"~€10-60/pp","timing":"Sep-Oct harvest  + Jun-Aug summer","draw_rank":4,"when_source":"derived from destination timing","timing_type":"SEASONAL-WINDOW","hook":"the gateway city''s food — the francesinha, the Mercado do Bolhão, the seafood — the essential pre-cruise graze","si":"culinary","blurb":"the gateway city''s food — the francesinha, the Mercado do Bolhão, the seafood — the essential pre-cruise graze","when":"Sep-Oct harvest  + Jun-Aug summer","commission":"bundle/venue","source":"https://www.cruisecritic.com/advice/river/douro-river","accessed":"2026-07-27"},{"name":"The Alto Douro UNESCO landscape","si_tag":"culture","status":"future","tier":"essential","price_band":"~€0-40","timing":"Sep-Oct harvest  + Jun-Aug summer","draw_rank":1,"when_source":"derived from destination timing","timing_type":"SEASONAL-WINDOW","hook":"a living 2,000-year cultural landscape of terraces, quintas and villages, inscribed 2001 — best read from the river or a terrace viewpoint","si":"culture","blurb":"a living 2,000-year cultural landscape of terraces, quintas and villages, inscribed 2001 — best read from the river or a terrace viewpoint","when":"Sep-Oct harvest  + Jun-Aug summer","commission":"DMC/tour wrapper","source":"https://whc.unesco.org/en/list/1046/","accessed":"2026-07-27"},{"name":"Porto''s Ribeira + the Gaia lodges","si_tag":"culture","status":"future","tier":"essential","price_band":"~€10-60","timing":"Sep-Oct harvest  + Jun-Aug summer","draw_rank":2,"when_source":"derived from destination timing","timing_type":"SEASONAL-WINDOW","hook":"the UNESCO old town tumbling to the water, the Dom Luís I bridge, and the Port houses opposite — the gateway''s set-piece","si":"culture","blurb":"the UNESCO old town tumbling to the water, the Dom Luís I bridge, and the Port houses opposite — the gateway''s set-piece","when":"Sep-Oct harvest  + Jun-Aug summer","commission":"operator/affiliate","source":"https://whc.unesco.org/en/list/1046/","accessed":"2026-07-27"},{"name":"The Port harvest, from terrace to lodge","si_tag":"deepdive","status":"future","tier":"comfort","price_band":"~€40-150/pp","timing":"harvest Sep-Oct","draw_rank":1,"hook":"the immersive September–October vindima — picking the vertiginous terraces, treading in lagares, the rabelo tradition that once carried the pipes downriver","si":"deepdive","blurb":"the immersive September–October vindima — picking the vertiginous terraces, treading in lagares, the rabelo tradition that once carried the pipes downriver","when":"harvest Sep-Oct","commission":"DMC/quinta 10-15%","source":"https://whc.unesco.org/en/list/1046/","accessed":"2026-07-27"},{"name":"Vine-therapy spas — Caudalie + Six Senses","si_tag":"wellness","status":"future","tier":"comfort","price_band":"~€60-350/pp","timing":"year-round","draw_rank":1,"timing_type":"ALWAYS-ON","hook":"The Yeatman''s Caudalie Vinothérapie Spa and Six Senses Douro Valley''s grape-antioxidant vineyard treatments — wellness built on the terroir itself","si":"wellness","blurb":"The Yeatman''s Caudalie Vinothérapie Spa and Six Senses Douro Valley''s grape-antioxidant vineyard treatments — wellness built on the terroir itself","when":"year-round","commission":"venue/host 10-15%","source":"https://www.the-yeatman-hotel.com/en/food/restaurant/","accessed":"2026-07-27"},{"name":"The low-exertion wine-and-river break","si_tag":"senior","status":"future","tier":"comfort","price_band":"~€150-500/day land","timing":"shoulder Apr-Jun + Oct ideal","draw_rank":1,"hook":"the dammed Douro''s gentle lock-cruising plus the scenic Porto–Pinhão railway make a rich, low-mobility itinerary","si":"senior","blurb":"the dammed Douro''s gentle lock-cruising plus the scenic Porto–Pinhão railway make a rich, low-mobility itinerary","when":"shoulder Apr-Jun + Oct ideal","commission":"cruise-line/DMC 10-16%","source":"https://www.cruisecritic.com/advice/river/douro-river","accessed":"2026-07-27"}],"faq":[{"q":"What''s the real risk to plan for in the Douro?","a":"Not crime — sun, water and the road: the terraces are steep and sun-exposed, the Douro is a dammed locked working river (follow crew on boats), and the N222 valley road is a tight switchback — use a driver or the Porto-Pinhao train, and never drive after tastings.","source":"whc.unesco.org","si_tag":"safety"},{"q":"When is the best time for a Douro cruise?","a":"Spring to autumn (roughly March-November), with September-October the harvest peak — you cruise past picking in progress and the quintas are liveliest, so harvest sailings book earliest.","source":"cruisecritic.com","si_tag":"river"},{"q":"Which cruise lines sail the Douro from Porto?","a":"Seven confirmed — Viking, AmaWaterways, Avalon, CroisiEurope, Scenic, Emerald and Uniworld — because Porto is the single embarkation gateway for the ~8-day run up to Regua, Pinhao and the Spanish border.","source":"cruisecritic.com","si_tag":"river"},{"q":"What''s the difference between Port and Douro wine?","a":"Both come from the same Alto Douro terraces, but Port is fortified and aged in the Vila Nova de Gaia lodges (an 18th-century tradition), while Douro DOC is unfortified table wine — taste both, one at a Gaia lodge, one at a valley quinta.","source":"whc.unesco.org","si_tag":"culinary"},{"q":"Where should I stay for a luxury Douro base?","a":"Two anchors: Six Senses Douro Valley, a restored 19th-century manor with a vineyard-heritage spa, for the valley itself; or The Yeatman above the Gaia Port lodges — 109 terraced river-view rooms, a two-Michelin-star table and a Caudalie Vinotherapie spa.","source":"scottdunn.com","si_tag":"ultra"},{"q":"Is the Douro good for a honeymoon?","a":"Yes — a quiet, high-romance wine landscape: a river-view quinta suite, a private terrace over the vines at sunset, and a Michelin dinner across from Porto''s lit Ribeira. It reads couples, not crowds.","source":"the-yeatman-hotel.com","si_tag":"romance"}],"seo":{"meta_title":"Douro Valley Travel Guide: River Cruises, Port Wine, the UNESCO Terraces & Porto","meta_description":"Plan Portugal''s Douro Valley — TravelWell''s second great river-cruise anchor: 7 cruise lines from Porto, the UNESCO Alto Douro terraces, the home of Port, The Yeatman''s two Michelin stars, Six Senses Douro Valley.","slug":"douro-valley-portugal","primary_keyword":"Douro Valley travel guide","long_tail":["Douro river cruise from Porto 2026","Alto Douro UNESCO wine region","Port wine Vila Nova de Gaia lodges","The Yeatman two Michelin stars","Six Senses Douro Valley","Pinhao Regua quinta tasting"],"search_language":"pt-PT","local_keywords":["Vale do Douro","cruzeiro no Douro","Alto Douro Vinhateiro UNESCO","vinho do Porto","caves de Vila Nova de Gaia","Douro DOC","Pinhao","Peso da Regua","quinta do Douro","The Yeatman","Six Senses Douro Valley","vindima"],"hreflang":["en","pt-PT"],"jsonld_type":"TouristDestination","content_freshness":"2026-07-27"},"booking":{"bin":"freely_bookable","level":"L1","codes":[],"advisory_updated":"2025-12-23","note":"Portugal US L1 (Exercise Normal Precautions), safest tier"},"si_checklist_25":{"run_date":"2026-07-27","hits":8,"misses":14,"disregarded":3,"note":"Canonical 25-SI list; sports limited to My Sports Travel (participant); spectator/prosports/compsports disregarded"},"sis_present":[{"si":"river","name":"river","status":"live"},{"si":"romance","name":"Romance, Marriages & Honeymoons","status":"live"},{"si":"culinary","name":"culinary","status":"future"},{"si":"culture","name":"Culture & History","status":"future"},{"si":"deepdive","name":"deepdive","status":"future"},{"si":"wellness","name":"Wellness Spas & Retreats","status":"future"},{"si":"senior","name":"senior","status":"future"}],"ultra":[{"name":"Six Senses Douro Valley — restored 19th-c. manor among the vines","why_ultra":"northern Portugal''s finest, vineyard-heritage spa, valley-terrace views","earning":"consortia/Virtuoso on application","virtuoso_value_add":true,"mor":"commissionable-rack","tier":"ultra","price_band":"~€500-1,200+/night"},{"name":"The Yeatman — 2-Michelin-star river-view suite over the Gaia lodges","why_ultra":"109 terraced rooms facing Porto''s Ribeira, two-star tasting menu, Caudalie Vinotherapie spa","earning":"consortia/host","virtuoso_value_add":true,"mor":"commissionable-rack","tier":"ultra","price_band":"~€400-1,000+/night"},{"name":"Luxury Douro cruise + private quinta harvest day (Uniworld/Scenic/Emerald)","why_ultra":"suite on a blue-ribbon Douro sailing with a private harvest visit + Port-house tasting","earning":"cruise-line/host 10-16%","virtuoso_value_add":true,"mor":"commissionable","tier":"ultra","price_band":"~€4,000-9,000+/pp"}],"source_verified":"2026-07-27","hero":{"query":"The Douro Valley, Portugal"},"geo":{"lat":41.1621,"lng":-7.7906}}'::jsonb, 9)
