n as a bulleted list, so the phrase regex never matched. Posture now comes from their own `alert_status` field first. ⛔ WHETHER THIS DESTINATION SITS INSIDE A NAMED AREA IS A JUDGEMENT AND IS A PERSON''S."}},"timing":{"peak":"Oct-Mar (cool season; cultural programming) - planning only","shoulder":"Mar & Oct edges","green":"Apr-Sep (extreme desert heat)","booking_lead":"N/A while held content-only (L3, consent gate not built)","off_season_specials":"n/a while held","event_peaks":"AlUla cultural/arts season (Maraya, festivals) in the cool months","campaign_start":"none while held; re-evaluate on de-escalation + consent gate"},"jewels":[{"name":"Hegra (Mada''in Salih, UNESCO)","si_tag":"culture","status":"future","tier":"premier","hook":"Saudi Arabia''s first UNESCO site; Nabataean tombs built more than 2,000 years ago","bookable_category":"attraction (held)","source":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/AlUla","timing":"Oct-Mar","when_source":"derived from destination timing","timing_type":"SEASONAL-WINDOW","si":"culture","blurb":"Saudi Arabia''s first UNESCO site; Nabataean tombs built more than 2,000 years ago","when":"Oct-Mar","commission":"held - experience/DMC when the gate exists"},{"name":"Dadan","si_tag":"culture","status":"future","tier":"premier","hook":"the ancient Lihyanite/Dadanite capital with rock-cut tombs and statues","bookable_category":"attraction (held)","source":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/AlUla","timing":"Oct-Mar","when_source":"derived from destination timing","timing_type":"SEASONAL-WINDOW","si":"culture","blurb":"the ancient Lihyanite/Dadanite capital with rock-cut tombs and statues","when":"Oct-Mar","commission":"held"},{"name":"Jabal Ikmah","si_tag":"culture","status":"future","tier":"premier","hook":"the open-air library of ~300 ancient inscriptions","bookable_category":"attraction (held)","source":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/AlUla","timing":"Oct-Mar","when_source":"derived from destination timing","timing_type":"SEASONAL-WINDOW","si":"cult