ok":"dawn balloon flights over the tombs and desert","bookable_category":"experience (held)","source":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/AlUla","timing":"Oct-Mar","when_source":"derived from destination timing","timing_type":"SEASONAL-WINDOW","si":"adventure","blurb":"dawn balloon flights over the tombs and desert","when":"Oct-Mar","commission":"held - experience when the gate exists"},{"name":"AlUla stargazing","si_tag":"globaladv","status":"future","tier":"comfort","hook":"dark-sky desert stargazing programmes","bookable_category":"experience (held)","source":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/AlUla","timing":"Oct-Mar","when_source":"derived from destination timing","timing_type":"SEASONAL-WINDOW","si":"adventure","blurb":"dark-sky desert stargazing programmes","when":"Oct-Mar","commission":"held"},{"name":"Via ferrata & rock climbing","si_tag":"globaladv","status":"future","tier":"comfort","hook":"fixed-line climbing routes in the sandstone","bookable_category":"experience (held)","source":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/AlUla","timing":"Oct-Mar","when_source":"derived from destination timing","timing_type":"SEASONAL-WINDOW","si":"adventure","blurb":"fixed-line climbing routes in the sandstone","when":"Oct-Mar","commission":"held"},{"name":"Desert hiking & dune experiences","si_tag":"globaladv","status":"future","tier":"comfort","hook":"guided hikes and dune outings","bookable_category":"experience (held)","source":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/AlUla","si":"adventure","blurb":"guided hikes and dune outings","commission":"held"},{"name":"Sharaan resort desert stay","si_tag":"ultra","status":"future","tier":"premier","hook":"a conservation-reserve luxury desert stay","bookable_category":"stay (held)","source":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/AlUla","timing":"Oct-Mar","when_source":"derived from destination timing","timing_type":"SEASONAL-WINDOW","si":"ultra","blurb":"a conservation-reserve luxury desert stay","when":"Oct-Mar","commission":"held"}],"faq":[{"q":"What is the current advisory for AlUla, and can I book it through TravelWell?","a":"Saudi Arabia is at U.S. State Department Level 3 - Reconsider Travel, and AlUla cannot be booked through TravelWell right now. The armed conflict that began 28 February 2026 (U.S./Israeli strikes on Iran; Iranian retaliatory strikes on all six GCC states; the Strait of Hormuz closed; a State ''depart now'' order on 2 March 2026) is ongoing as of 2026-08-10. TravelWell books Level 3 only through a consent gate that is not built, so no Gulf destination is bookable regardless of level. Saudi Arabia''s advisory has historically carried stricter sub-national carve-outs (near the Yemen border and in the Eastern Province) - far from AlUla, but verify them against the live advisory. Re-verify everything before any travel.","source":"level+conflict supplied by Strategy Claude from a 2026-08-09 read of the US Embassy UAE alert 4 Jun 2026 (Saudi listed L3) + State-advisory press; carve-outs + FCDO flagged, not read in this build","si_tag":"safety"},{"q":"How are flights affected?","a":"Gulf airports are open but subject to short-notice closures; American Airlines cancelled Philadelphia-Doha through the end of 2026 as one regional example, and AlUla is reached via a domestic connection (often through Riyadh or Jeddah). Confirm every segment close to departure.","source":"supplied by Strategy Claude from a 2026-08-09 read","si_tag":"safety"},{"q":"What would an AlUla trip cover once bookable again?","a":"Hegra (Mada''in Salih) and its Nabataean tombs, Dadan and the Jabal Ikmah inscriptions, AlUla Old Town''s oasis walk, Elephant Rock, the mirrored Maraya concert hall, the Sharaan Nature Reserve, and desert experiences - stargazing, hot-air ballooning over Hegra, hiking and via ferrata.","source":"en.wikipedia.org/wiki/AlUla (accessed 2026-08-10)","si_tag":"planning"},{"q":"When is the best time to visit AlUla?","a":"October-March is the cool season and the cultural-programming window; summer is extreme desert heat. Planning-only guidance while the destination is held content-only.","source":"en.wikipedia.org/wiki/AlUla (accessed 2026-08-10)","si_tag":"planning"},{"q":"Is there anything specific to know about safety and local law?","a":"Beyond the regional conflict and flight disruption, Saudi Arabia enforces conservative local laws; AlUla itself is a developed heritage destination, but the binding constraints right now are the Level 3 advisory, the carve-outs to verify, and the content-only hold. Re-verify the advisory before acting on anything here.","source":"level supplied by Strategy Claude from a 2026-08-09 read; en.wikipedia.org/wiki/AlUla (accessed 2026-08-10)","si_tag":"safety"}],"seo":{"meta_title":"AlUla Travel Advisory & Guide (Saudi Arabia): Level 3","meta_description":"AlUla under a U.S. Level 3 advisory amid the 2026 Gulf conflict - safety, flight disruption, and the sights (Hegra, Maraya, Sharaan) for when travel resumes. Held content-only.","slug":"alula-saudi-arabia","primary_keyword":"AlUla travel advisory 2026","long_tail":["AlUla Level 3","Hegra Mada''in Salih","Saudi Arabia safety 2026","Maraya AlUla","Elephant Rock AlUla"],"search_language":"ar (restated, not machine-translated)","local_keywords":["العلا","الحجر","مرايا العلا"],"hreflang":["en","ar"],"jsonld_type":"TouristDestination","content_freshness":"2026-08-10"},"booking":{"bin":"content_only_L3_consent_gate_not_built","level":"L3","booking_hold":true,"codes":["L3"],"note":"HELD CONTENT-ONLY. US State Level 3 (Reconsider Travel) for Saudi Arabia amid an active regional conflict that began 28 Feb 2026 (US/Israeli strikes on Iran; Iranian retaliatory strikes on all six GCC states; Hormuz closed; State depart-now for 16 countries 2 Mar 2026), ONGOING as of 2026-08-10. L3 books only via the consent gate, which Sana confirms is NOT built. CARVE-OUTS FLAGGED, NOT READ: Saudi historically names Yemen-border + Eastern-Province (Qatif) zones (far from AlUla) - verify at travel.state.gov. FAST-MOVING: re-verify. CITATION: level+conflict supplied by Strategy Claude from a 2026-08-09 read of the US Embassy UAE alert 4 Jun 2026 (Saudi listed L3) + State-advisory press; FCDO wording for Saudi NOT read in this build (required second source - verify); conflict corroborated 2026-08-10 via F1/FIA GP-cancellation coverage (Sky Sports/PlanetF1, web search)."},"si_checklist_25":{"run_date":"2026-08-10","hits":4,"misses":18,"disregarded":3,"note":"Heritage-desert destination built content-only (safety gap); all SIs future while held; spectator/prosports/compsports disregarded"},"sis_present":[{"si":"culture","name":"culture","status":"future"},{"si":"globaladv","name":"adventure","status":"future"},{"si":"entertainment","name":"entertainment","status":"future"},{"si":"ultra","name":"ultra","status":"future"}],"ultra":[{"name":"HELD - Sharaan luxury desert stay + private Hegra tour + dawn balloon flight, via the consent gate once built","why_ultra":"the ultra pull once the advisory de-escalates and the gate exists; not offered while held","earning":"n/a while held","virtuoso_value_add":"n/a while held","mor":"n/a while held","source":"TWW booking doctrine"}],"source_verified":"2026-08-10","hero":{"query":"AlUla, Saudi Arabia"},"geo":{"lat":26.62,"lng":37.92}}'::jsonb, 2),
