  ('dead-sea-jordan', '04A', 'Dead Sea', 'Jordan', 'Float on the lowest water on Earth, then let', 'live', 'verified', 'spaWellness', 'Jordan & the Levant', '{"wellness","ultra"}', '{}', '{"essential","comfort","premier","ultra"}', null, 'core', '{"key_facts":["The lowest point on Earth - roughly 430 m (about 1,410 ft) below sea level","Hypersaline (about 10x the ocean) - you float effortlessly; the black mineral mud is a wellness ritual","A luxury spa-resort strip along the western shore, about 1 hour from Amman","The gentle third leg - pairs with Petra + Wadi Rum for the full Jordan loop","US Level 3 Reconsider Travel (March 2026); the Level-4 areas are the Syria/Iraq borders - the Dead Sea is in the west, far from them","Mild in winter (a wellness/sun window); very hot in summer"],"safety":{"emergency":"911 (unified - police / ambulance / civil defense); Tourist Police +962 79 550 5755","hospital":"Amman (~1 hr) for major referral; carry travel-medical + evac insurance","advisory_level":"L3","activity_note":"L3 Reconsider Travel - disclose prominently. Level-4 areas = Syria/Iraq borders (far north/east); the Dead Sea resort strip is in the west, far from them. Float safety: never submerge/get salt in eyes, no shaving beforehand, rinse in fresh water, short early floats; heart/BP conditions check first. Summer heat at the lowest point on Earth - hydrate.","fcdo":{"posture":"AREA-RESTRICTED","quotes":[{"form":"against all travel","text":"advises against all travel to within 3km of the border with Syria."},{"form":"against all travel","text":"advises against all travel to Syria."},{"form":"against all travel","text":"advises against all travel to Iraq ."},{"form":"against all travel","text":"advises against all travel to the provinces in Iraq bordering Jordan."},{"form":"against all but essential travel","text":"advises against all but essential travel Aqaba Governate FCDO advises against all but essential travel to Aqaba international airport and seaport."},{"form"