consortia/DMC","si":"ultra","blurb":"a resort suite over the lowest water on Earth, a bespoke spa/mud program, and Petra + Wadi Rum an easy drive away. Earning: consortia/DMC","when":"year-round","commission":"consortia/DMC"}],"faq":[{"q":"What is the Dead Sea?","a":"The lowest point on Earth - a hypersaline lake about 430 m below sea level where you float without effort. The mineral mud is a spa ritual, and a strip of luxury wellness resorts lines the western shore about an hour from Amman.","source":"geographic references","si_tag":"wellness"},{"q":"When is the best time to visit the Dead Sea?","a":"Spring (Mar-May) and autumn (Sep-Nov) are ideal. It''s mild in winter - a good winter-sun and wellness window when Europe is cold - and very hot in summer, when you tour the shore early and late and lean on the pool and spa.","source":"tourism references","si_tag":"wellness"}],"seo":{"meta_title":"Dead Sea Jordan Guide: Float, Spa Resorts & Safety - Best Time to Visit (2026)","meta_description":"Plan the Dead Sea in Jordan - float on the lowest point on Earth, mineral-mud spa resorts, a mild winter-wellness window, an hour from Amman, with straight Level-3 safety intel.","slug":"dead-sea-jordan","primary_keyword":"Dead Sea Jordan","long_tail":["Dead Sea float","Dead Sea spa resort","is the Dead Sea safe","lowest point on Earth","Dead Sea winter","Dead Sea mud"],"search_language":"en","local_keywords":["Dead Sea","Sweimeh","lowest point on Earth","mineral mud"],"hreflang":["en","ar","de"],"jsonld_type":"TouristDestination","content_freshness":"2026-08-03"},"booking":{"bin":"book_with_disclosure","level":"L3","codes":["reconsider-travel","regional-tensions","terrorism"],"book_suppressed":false,"note":"Jordan US Level 3 Reconsider Travel (escalated March 2026, regional US-Iran tensions). Disclose PROMINENTLY; heightened-consent booking. Level-4 Do-Not-Travel areas = Syria + Iraq border strips + Mansheyat al Ghayyath + Ruwayshid - the Dead Sea resort strip is in the WEST, far from them. Resorts operate through 2026. Re-verify each cycle (may revert to L2)."},"si_checklist_25":{"run_date":"2026-08-03","hits":2,"misses":19,"disregarded":3,"note":"Wellness leg: wellness (float/spa/mud) + ultra (resort spas) live; romance (couples spa) + senior (easy float, restful) future. sub_region ''Jordan & Petra'' PROPOSED. US L3 - disclose. Exact below-sea-level metre varies ~430-440 - use ~430 m."},"sis_present":[{"si":"wellness","name":"wellness","status":"live","note":"effortless float on the lowest point on Earth, mineral-mud rituals, resort spa strip"},{"si":"ultra","name":"ultra","status":"live","note":"luxury shore-front wellness resorts + private spa programs"}],"ultra":[{"name":"A shore-front luxury wellness suite + private spa program","why_ultra":"a resort suite over the lowest water on Earth, a bespoke spa/mud program, and Petra + Wadi Rum an easy drive away","earning":"consortia/DMC","virtuoso_value_add":false,"mor":"commissionable-rack","tier":"ultra","price_band":"on application"}],"source_verified":"2026-08-03","hero":{"query":"Dead Sea, Jordan"},"geo":{"lat":31.559,"lng":35.4732}}'::jsonb, 7),
