estart targeted for January 2027, and Gulf airports generally are open but subject to short-notice closures. Confirm every segment close to departure and expect routing changes.","source":"supplied by Strategy Claude from a 2026-08-09 read","si_tag":"safety"},{"q":"What would a Doha trip cover once bookable again?","a":"The Museum of Islamic Art and its park, Souq Waqif in the evening, the National Museum of Qatar, a Corniche walk with the dhow harbour, Katara Cultural Village, The Pearl and Msheireb Downtown, Education City (Qatar National Library, Mathaf), and a Khor Al Adaid inland-sea desert safari.","source":"en.wikivoyage.org/wiki/Doha (accessed 2026-08-10)","si_tag":"planning"},{"q":"When is the best time to visit Doha?","a":"November-March is the cool, dry season; summer is extreme (above 40C with high humidity). Planning-only guidance while the destination is held content-only.","source":"en.wikivoyage.org/wiki/Doha (accessed 2026-08-10)","si_tag":"planning"},{"q":"Is there anything specific to know about safety in the city itself?","a":"Beyond the regional conflict and the flight disruption, Doha''s own street-crime level is low; the binding constraints right now are the Level 3 advisory, the flight risk, and the content-only hold. Re-verify the advisory before acting on anything here.","source":"levels supplied by Strategy Claude from a 2026-08-09 read; en.wikivoyage.org/wiki/Doha (accessed 2026-08-10)","si_tag":"safety"}],"seo":{"meta_title":"Doha Travel Advisory & Guide (Qatar): Level 3, Safety","meta_description":"Doha under a U.S. Level 3 advisory amid the 2026 Gulf conflict - the safety picture, the Philadelphia-Doha flight cut, and the sights for when travel resumes. Held content-only.","slug":"doha-qatar","primary_keyword":"Doha travel advisory 2026","long_tail":["Doha Level 3 Reconsider Travel","Qatar safety 2026","Philadelphia Doha flight cancelled","Museum of Islamic Art","Souq Waqif"],"search_language":"ar (restated, not machine-translated)","local_keywords":["الدوحة","متحف الفن الإسلامي","سوق واقف"],"hreflang":["en","ar"],"jsonld_type":"TouristDestination","content_freshness":"2026-08-10"},"booking":{"bin":"content_only_L3_consent_gate_not_built","level":"L3","booking_hold":true,"codes":["L3"],"note":"HELD CONTENT-ONLY. US State Level 3 (Reconsider Travel) for Qatar amid an active regional conflict that began 28 Feb 2026 (US/Israeli strikes on Iran; Iranian retaliatory strikes on all six GCC states; Hormuz closed; State depart-now for 16 countries 2 Mar 2026), ONGOING as of 2026-08-10. L3 books only via the consent gate, which Sana confirms is NOT built. FAST-MOVING: re-verify State + FCDO before travel. Doha is the named flight-disruption example: American Airlines cancelled Philadelphia-Doha through end-2026 (restart targeted Jan 2027). CITATION: level+conflict supplied by Strategy Claude from a 2026-08-09 read of the US Embassy UAE alert 4 Jun 2026 (Qatar listed among the L3 states) + State-advisory press; ae.usembassy.gov returned ''Technical Difficulties'' to a 2026-08-10 re-fetch; conflict corroborated 2026-08-10 via F1/FIA GP-cancellation coverage (Sky Sports/PlanetF1 via web search)."},"si_checklist_25":{"run_date":"2026-08-10","hits":4,"misses":18,"disregarded":3,"note":"Gulf capital built content-only (safety gap); all SIs future while held; spectator/prosports/compsports disregarded"},"sis_present":[{"si":"culture","name":"culture","status":"future"},{"si":"entertainment","name":"entertainment","status":"future"},{"si":"globaladv","name":"adventure","status":"future"},{"si":"family","name":"family","status":"future"}],"ultra":[{"name":"HELD - Pearl/Msheireb luxury stay + Museum of Islamic Art + Khor Al Adaid inland-sea overnight, via the consent gate once built","why_ultra":"the ultra pull once the advisory de-escalates and the gate exists; not offered while held","earning":"n/a while held","virtuoso_value_add":"n/a while held","mor":"n/a while held","source":"TWW booking doctrine"}],"source_v